{"id":"vod_bf_16418","vodId":"16418","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"惊爆游戏","name_cn":"惊爆游戏","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-17/3e6b69eb0a7846b972063124243c7c96.jpg"},"summary":"在现实中，坂本龙太（本乡奏多 配音）是一个个性孤僻沉默寡言的宅男，但在网络游戏“BTOOOM！” 里，龙太则化身成为了实力超强的世界级玩家。令龙太意想不到的是，在某一天，本该属于虚拟世界中的厮杀蔓延到了现实世界里来，连他在内的数十位男女被某个神秘组织强制带往了一个荒岛上，在那里，进行着与网络游戏同名的真人游戏。为了生存，龙太必须利用自己的能力同素不相识的陌生人们战斗到底。　　金发碧眼的少女卑弥呼（三森铃子 配音），曾经的好友织田信隆（中村悠一 配音），狡猾残暴的今川义名（奈良辙 配音），有着双重人格的吉良康介（泽城美雪 配音），他们为何会被卷入这场游戏？又是谁在背后操控着大局？一切尚在迷雾之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 04:31:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jingbaoyouxi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jingbaoyouxi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jingbaoyouxi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jingbaoyouxi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jingbaoyouxi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jingbaoyouxi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jingbaoyouxi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jingbaoyouxi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jingbaoyouxi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jingbaoyouxi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jingbaoyouxi/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jingbaoyouxi/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:29.441Z"}